  "body": "## Change\n\nAccept empty reserved model-space and paper-space definitions in the DXF BLOCKS section. Validate the record order and any supplied block record owner. Accept a bounded set of empty drawing dictionaries with validated entries and owner links. Report unsupported block geometry, object types and invalid references.\n\nThe importer previously required a literally empty BLOCKS section and refused OBJECTS. Those checks prevented a stock-face sketch from reaching the geometry reader even when these sections contained no drawing geometry.\n\nThe implementation follows the published DXF record structure. [Autodesk BLOCKS reference](https://help.autodesk.com/cloudhelp/2025/ENU/AutoCAD-DXF/files/GUID-A3E4F1D3-79C9-489C-B7EC-3924DA7F25C9.htm) and [DICTIONARY reference](https://help.autodesk.com/cloudhelp/2024/ENU/AutoCAD-DXF/files/GUID-40B92C63-26F0-485B-A9C2-B349099B26D0.htm). It uses original synthetic tests. Actual block insertion and object geometry remain outside this change. See #1865.\n\n## Verification\n\nExact contributor head: `636518a0a79016dbfb13c9d2c098faf3da2a17d1`. Base: `5e76e6a14b366c510858bbbf660c06ca013c34d4`.\n\nThe documented targeted quick check passed. All 44 tests passed in the five DXF suites. Strict Clippy passed for all geometry targets. Formatting on changed files and diff whitespace passed.\n\nThe new pins are:\n\n- `empty_space_definitions_and_dictionary_forest_preserve_the_document`\n- `layout_wrappers_refuse_geometry_external_content_and_broken_structure`\n- `dictionary_entries_must_form_a_closed_acyclic_ownership_graph`\n- `metadata_collections_obey_the_entity_limit`\n\nAn independent normal CLI check imported the synthetic control sketch with and without the metadata. Both produced identical feature JSON. The CLI refused an embedded block shape and a dangling dictionary. A separate normal import and project reopen retained stable chain identities.\n\nThe full quick gate passed all 1,038 steps on `636518a0a`, including strict Clippy. The reached heavy gate passed all 236 motion and application steps on the same revision. Both commands exited with status 0.\n\n```sh\ncargo xtask gate quick --base 5e76e6a14b366c510858bbbf660c06ca013c34d4\ncargo xtask gate heavy --base 5e76e6a14b366c510858bbbf660c06ca013c34d4\n```\n\nA trial merge with upstream main at `a35c9cb81` completed without conflicts.\n\nEffort: high. No escalation.\n\n## Scope\n\nOnly DXF intake changes. The straight or curved Wire Contour planner and all machine posts retain their separate qualification requirements. No native controller job or physical cut is part of this parser check. No reference drawing or controller program is included.\n\nChangelog: DXF stock-face import accepts validated empty layout definitions and drawing dictionaries.\n\nFixes #3176\n",
